---

<BaseLayout
  title="Studio 1947 Local | Support for Local Businesses"
  description="Websites, branding and digital support for independent businesses in Mirik, Darjeeling and the surrounding hills. Explore services and clear pricing."
  ogType="website"
  bodyClass="page-onlyforlocals"
  noindex={true}
>
  <main class="page-onlyforlocals">
    <!-- ===== Hero ===== -->
    <figure class="rc-hero">
      <h1 class="sr-only">Studio 1947 Local: Professional support for local businesses</h1>
      <img src="/assets/img/onlyforlocals/hero-lineart.webp" alt="Studio 1947 Local: a couple outside their small hillside home and shop, with a jeep on the mountain road" loading="eager" />
    </figure>

    <section class="section container rc-intro">
      <div class="rc-why__heading">
        <p class="eyebrow rc-eyebrow">Studio 1947 Local</p>
        <h2 class="rc-h2">Professional support for local businesses.</h2>
        <p class="rc-lead-body">Websites, branding and digital support for shops, homestays and family-run services<br />across Mirik, Darjeeling and the surrounding hills, priced for small local businesses.</p>
        <a class="rc-why__cta" href="#one-time-setup">
          <span>Explore Local Solutions</span>
          <span class="rc-why__cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== Why this rate card exists: full-bleed, edge to edge ===== -->
    <section class="rc-why">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="rc-why__top">
          <div class="rc-why__headtext">
            <p class="eyebrow rc-eyebrow">Why This Rate Card Exists</p>
            <h2 class="rc-h2">Built for the businesses<br />close to home.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="marquee rc-clients-marquee rc-clients-marquee--why">
            <div class="marquee__track">
              <span class="rc-clients-marquee__name">Bhagirath Homestay</span>
              <span class="rc-clients-marquee__name">Kulam Homestay</span>
              <span class="rc-clients-marquee__name">Mohuna Media</span>
              <span class="rc-clients-marquee__name">AIMS Coaching Institute</span>
              <span class="rc-clients-marquee__name">Easy Stay</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rc-why__grid">
          <article class="rc-why__card">
            <span class="rc-why__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="rc-why__card-body">
              <h3>Why we built this</h3>
              <p>Many homestays, shops and family-run services around Mirik and Darjeeling need a website, a Google listing or a stronger digital presence, but standard agency packages can be beyond their budgets. Studio 1947 Local offers focused services with clear deliverables and practical prices, making professional support easier to access.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="rc-why__card">
            <span class="rc-why__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 4.8-7 11-7 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="rc-why__card-body">
              <h3>What counts as "local"</h3>
              <p>A business rooted in and run from Mirik, Darjeeling or the surrounding hills: a family renting out homestay rooms, a neighbourhood shop, an independent driver, or a small service run by one person or one family. This programme is designed around the everyday needs of independently operated local businesses.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="rc-why__card">
            <span class="rc-why__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M8 4v5"/></svg>
            </span>
            <div class="rc-why__card-body">
              <h3>When our regular services fit better</h3>
              <p>Larger campaigns, custom platforms and projects with broader requirements need a different scope. Businesses, startups and NGOs with dedicated project funding or more extensive needs can work with Studio 1947 through our <a href="/solutions/">regular solutions</a>. This keeps the local programme focused on the small businesses it was built to support.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="rc-layout container">
    <div class="rc-layout__main">
    <!-- ===== One-time costs: thumbnail cards ===== -->
    <section id="one-time-setup" class="section">
      <p class="eyebrow rc-eyebrow">One-Time Setup</p>
      <h2 class="rc-h2">Start with what your business needs.</h2>
      <p class="rc-lead-body">Choose individual services with clear deliverables and upfront prices.</p>
      <div class="rc-cards" data-calc-onetime>
        {oneTime.map((s, idx) => (
          <article class="rc-card" id={s.id}>
            <div class="rc-card__media">
              {s.thumb ? (
                <img src={s.thumb} alt={`${s.title} illustration`} loading="lazy" />
              ) : (
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" set:html={icons[s.icon]} />
              )}
            </div>
            <div class="rc-card__body">
              <span class="rc-card__id">S47 LOCAL SERVICE {String(idx + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
              <div class="rc-card__head">
                <h3>{s.title}</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="rc-card__pricebox">
                <span class="rc-card__price">{s.options ? `₹${s.options[0].value.toLocaleString('en-IN')}` : s.price}</span>
                <span class="rc-card__gst">
                  {(() => {
                    const base = s.options ? s.options[0].value : s.priceValue;
                    return base ? `+ ₹${Math.round(base * 0.18).toLocaleString('en-IN')} GST (18%)` : '+ 18% GST';
                  })()}
                </span>
              </div>
              {s.options && (
                <div class="rc-card__toggle">
                  {s.options.map((o, i) => (
                    <label class="rc-card__toggle-opt">
                      <input type="radio" name={`calc-${s.id}`} value={o.value} data-desc={o.desc} checked={i === 0} />
                      <span>{o.label}<em>₹{o.value.toLocaleString('en-IN')}</em></span>
                    </label>
                  ))}
                </div>
              )}
              <div class="rc-card__terms">
                <p class="rc-card__terms-label">Studio 1947 provides</p>
                <ul class="rc-card__list rc-card__list--yes">
                  {s.provides.map((i, idx) => <li data-calc-provide={s.options && idx === 0 ? '' : undefined}>{i}</li>)}
                </ul>
                {s.clientProvides.length > 0 && (
                  <>
                    <p class="rc-card__terms-label">You provide</p>
                    <ul class="rc-card__list rc-card__list--you">
                      {s.clientProvides.map((c) => <li>{c}</li>)}
                    </ul>
                  </>
                )}
                {s.notIncluded.length > 0 && (
                  <>
                    <p class="rc-card__terms-label">Not included</p>
                    <ul class="rc-card__list rc-card__list--no">
                      {s.notIncluded.map((e) => <li>{e}</li>)}
                    </ul>
                  </>
                )}
              </div>
              <label class="rc-card__add">
                <input type="checkbox" data-calc-item={s.options ? s.options[0].value : s.priceValue} value={s.options ? s.options[0].value : s.priceValue} />
                <span class="rc-card__add-on">Add this Service <span class="rc-card__add-icon">+</span></span>
                <span class="rc-card__add-off">Remove this Service <span class="rc-card__add-icon">✕</span></span>
              </label>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== Social media marketing: 3 tiers ===== -->
    <section class="section">
      <p class="eyebrow rc-eyebrow">Monthly Commitment</p>
      <h2 class="rc-h2">Stay active. Stay connected.</h2>
      <p class="rc-lead-body">Monthly social media support to help your business show up consistently and stay in touch with customers.</p>
      <div class="rc-tiers">
        {socialTiers.map((t, i) => (
          <article class:list={['rc-tier', t.featured && 'rc-tier--featured']}>
            {t.featured && <span class="rc-tier__badge">Most popular</span>}
            <div class="rc-tier__body">
              <h3 class="rc-tier__name">{t.name}</h3>
              <p class="rc-tier__tagline">{t.tagline}</p>
              <p class="rc-tier__price">{t.price}<span>/month</span></p>
              <div class="rc-tier__divider"></div>
              <p class="rc-tier__terms-label">{t.basePlan ? `Everything in ${t.basePlan}, plus` : "What's included"}</p>
              <ul class="rc-card__list rc-card__list--yes rc-tier__list">
                {t.deliverables.map((d) => <li>{d}</li>)}
              </ul>
              <div class="rc-tier__pick">
                <label class:list={['rc-tier__cta', t.featured && 'rc-tier__cta--solid']}>
                  <input type="radio" name="calc-social" data-calc-item={`monthly:${t.priceValue}`} checked={i === 0} />
                  <span class="rc-tier__cta-on">Add this plan</span>
                  <span class="rc-tier__cta-off">
                    <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
                    Selected
                  </span>
                </label>
                <button type="button" class="rc-tier__remove" data-calc-remove-tier>
                  Remove this Service <span class="rc-card__add-icon">✕</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>
    </div>

    <!-- ===== Live calculator: sticky on desktop, bottom on mobile ===== -->
    <aside class="rc-layout__aside">
      <div class="rc-calc">
        <div class="rc-calc__head">
          <h2 class="rc-h2">Your Package Calculator</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="rc-calc__totals">
          <div class="rc-calc__col">
            <span class="rc-calc__label">One-time</span>
            <div class="rc-calc__row"><span>Subtotal</span><span data-calc-onetime-sub>₹0</span></div>
            <div class="rc-calc__row"><span>GST (18%)</span><span data-calc-onetime-gst>₹0</span></div>
            <div class="rc-calc__row rc-calc__row--grand"><span>Grand Total</span><span data-calc-onetime-total>₹0</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="rc-calc__col">
            <span class="rc-calc__label">Monthly</span>
            <div class="rc-calc__row"><span>Subtotal</span><span data-calc-monthly-sub>₹0</span></div>
            <div class="rc-calc__row"><span>GST (18%)</span><span data-calc-monthly-gst>₹0</span></div>
            <div class="rc-calc__row rc-calc__row--grand"><span>Grand Total</span><span data-calc-monthly-total>₹0</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rc-calc__interest" data-calc-interest-wrap hidden>
          <span class="rc-calc__label">Also Interested In</span>
          <ul class="rc-calc__interest-list" data-calc-interest-list></ul>
        </div>
        <div class="rc-calc__cta-block">
          <p class="rc-calc__cta-heading">Send this straight to the<br />Studio 1947 team on WhatsApp.</p>
          <div class="rc-calc__actions">
            <button type="button" class="rc-calc__book" data-calc-whatsapp>
              <span>WhatsApp</span>
              <span class="rc-calc__book-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <a class="rc-calc__book rc-calc__book--outline" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/mNnNQbUaWLFf5Xw79" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <span>Visit our Office</span>
              <span class="rc-calc__book-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M7 17 17 7"/><path d="M8 7h9v9"/></svg>
              </span>
            </a>
          </div>
